# libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor-facing repository rules and workflows. Its scope is how humans and agents set up the environment, write documentation, communicate, define requirements, and contribute safely through the project lifecycle."
msgstr "ويتضمن هذا الدليل قواعد ودائع المستودعات الخاصة بالمساهمين وسير العمل. Its scope is how humans and agents set up the environment, write documentation, communicate, define requirements, and contribute safely through the project life cycle."

# libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains custom **Ansible filter plugins** used within the Infinito.Nexus project."
msgstr "هذا الدليل يحتوي على العرف **مرشّح قابل للذوبان** المستخدمة داخل Infinito.Nexus مشروع."

# libretranslate
